Electricity production facilities on municipal
SF0054
property.
Sponsored By: Joint Corporations, Elections & Political
Subdivisions Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to cities and towns; clarifying that cities and towns are
authorized to construct electricity production facilities; clarifying when
revenue bonds can be issued for electricity production facilities; specifying
that cities and towns operating electricity production facilities pursuant to
an agreement are not public utilities; and providing for an effective date.
